{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51724","headline":"因聘女自爲内相醉酬新郎催妆之诗（诗意风艳之甚，亲族闻者，莫不笑之。） · 马彦珪","name":"因聘女自爲内相醉酬新郎催妆之诗（诗意风艳之甚，亲族闻者，莫不笑之。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫飞篇翰苦相煎，款款容人帖翠钿。\n不是到来梳洗晚，却忧玉体未禁怜。\n（同上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马彦珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}